OL,4,CCapita shares plunge 70% as boss quits 
OL,5,Cafter civil service pensions failure   
OL,6,GShares in outsourcing business Capita  
OL,7,Ghave sunk 70% after its boss stepped   
OL,8,Gdown as the saga over public sector    
OL,9,Gpensions drags on.                     
OL,11,FChief executive Adolfo Hernandez has   
OL,12,Fagreed with the firm's board to leave  
OL,13,Fwith "immediate effect", admitting     
OL,14,Fthat the company had "not delivered"   
OL,15,Ffor members of the UK's Civil Service  
OL,16,Fpension scheme.                        
